### Get latest cars
GET http://localhost:5500/api/cars

###

### Filter by make
GET http://localhost:5500/api/cars?make=Toyota

###

### Filter by model
GET http://localhost:5500/api/cars?model=Harrier

###

### Filter by year
GET http://localhost:5500/api/cars?year=2022

###

### Filter by price range
GET http://localhost:5500/api/cars?minPrice=20000000&maxPrice=50000000

###

### Get single vehicle
GET http://localhost:5500/api/cars/1

###

### Create vehicle
POST http://localhost:5500/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: 

{
  "vin":"123ABC",
  "make":"Toyota",
  "model":"Harrier",
  "year":2022,
  "price":45000000,
  "mileage":5000
}

### Sprint 3 Edwin - Valid car payload
POST http://localhost:5500/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "name": "Toyota Harrier",
  "brand": "Toyota",
  "type": "SUV",
  "category": "luxury",
  "year": 2024,
  "price": 85000000,
  "mileage": 50000,
  "power": "200 HP",
  "engine": "2.0L",
  "drive": "AWD",
  "images": [
    "https://example.com/car.jpg"
  ]
}

### Sprint 3 Edwin - Invalid price as text
POST http://localhost:5500/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "name": "Toyota Harrier",
  "brand": "Toyota",
  "type": "SUV",
  "category": "luxury",
  "year": 2024,
  "price": "abc<script>",
  "mileage": 50000
}

### Expected response
# 400 Bad Request
# Price must be a valid positive number.

### Sprint 3 Edwin - Invalid empty price
POST http://localhost:5500/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "name": "Toyota Harrier",
  "brand": "Toyota",
  "type": "SUV",
  "category": "luxury",
  "year": 2024,
  "price": "",
  "mileage": 50000
}

### Expected response
# 400 Bad Request
# Price is required.

