### Sprint 3 Edwin - Missing required name
POST http://localhost:5500/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "brand": "Toyota",
  "type": "SUV",
  "category": "luxury",
  "year": 2024,
  "price": 85000000,
  "mileage": 50000
}

### Expected response
# 400 Bad Request
# name is required.

### Sprint 3 Edwin - Malformed images payload
POST http://localhost:5500/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "name": "Toyota Harrier",
  "brand": "Toyota",
  "type": "SUV",
  "category": "luxury",
  "year": 2024,
  "price": 85000000,
  "mileage": 50000,
  "images": "not-an-array"
}

### Expected response
# 400 Bad Request
# Images must be submitted as an array of image URLs.

